===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} For a [[complex number]] <math>a+bi</math>, the [[principal square root]] of the [[sum]] of the [[square]]s of its [[real]] and [[imaginary]] parts, <math>\sqrt{a^2+b^2}</math>. Denoted by vertical bars <math>| \, |</math>. {{C|en|Functions}}
#: The absolute value <math>|x|</math> of a real number <math>x</math> is <math>\sqrt{x^2}</math>, which is equal to <math>x</math> if <math>x</math> is non-negative, and <math>-x</math> if <math>x</math> is negative.

